# React Material-UI Styling

## Rule Overview

**CRITICAL:** This project uses Material-UI's styling solution (`sx` prop, `styled()`, and theme system). Never use Tailwind CSS, CSS modules, or inline styles with string classes.

## Primary Styling Method: sx Prop

The `sx` prop is the preferred way to style MUI components. It provides:
- Direct access to theme values
- Responsive styling
- TypeScript support
- Better performance than inline styles

### Basic Usage

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Using Tailwind CSS classes
<Box className="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-100">
  <Typography className="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Title</Typography>
  <Button className="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-700">Action</Button>
</Box>

// ✅ CORRECT - Using sx prop
<Box sx={{ 
  display: 'flex', 
  alignItems: 'center', 
  justifyContent: 'space-between',
  p: 4,  // padding: theme.spacing(4)
  bgcolor: 'grey.100'
}}>
  <Typography sx={{ 
    fontSize: '2rem', 
    fontWeight: 'bold',
    color: 'grey.900'
  }}>
    Title
  </Typography>
  <Button sx={{ 
    bgcolor: 'primary.main',
    '&:hover': { bgcolor: 'primary.dark' }
  }}>
    Action
  </Button>
</Box>
```

## Tailwind to sx Prop Conversion Guide

### Layout & Spacing

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `flex` | `display: 'flex'` | Flexbox |
| `flex-col` | `flexDirection: 'column'` | Flex column |
| `flex-row` | `flexDirection: 'row'` | Flex row |
| `items-center` | `alignItems: 'center'` | Vertical centering |
| `items-start` | `alignItems: 'flex-start'` | Align start |
| `justify-center` | `justifyContent: 'center'` | Horizontal centering |
| `justify-between` | `justifyContent: 'space-between'` | Space between |
| `gap-2` | `gap: 2` | Gap (theme.spacing(2)) |
| `gap-4` | `gap: 4` | Gap (theme.spacing(4)) |
| `space-y-4` | `'& > * + *': { mt: 4 }` or use `<Stack spacing={4}>` | Vertical spacing |
| `space-x-2` | `'& > * + *': { ml: 2 }` or use `<Stack direction="row" spacing={2}>` | Horizontal spacing |

### Padding & Margin

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `p-4` | `p: 4` | Padding all sides (theme.spacing(4)) |
| `px-4` | `px: 4` | Horizontal padding |
| `py-4` | `py: 4` | Vertical padding |
| `pt-4` | `pt: 4` | Padding top |
| `pr-4` | `pr: 4` | Padding right |
| `pb-4` | `pb: 4` | Padding bottom |
| `pl-4` | `pl: 4` | Padding left |
| `m-4` | `m: 4` | Margin all sides |
| `mx-auto` | `mx: 'auto'` | Horizontal centering |
| `my-4` | `my: 4` | Vertical margin |

### Sizing

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `w-full` | `width: '100%'` or `width: 1` | Full width |
| `w-1/2` | `width: '50%'` or `width: 0.5` | Half width |
| `w-64` | `width: 256` or `width: '256px'` | Fixed width (256px) |
| `h-full` | `height: '100%'` or `height: 1` | Full height |
| `h-screen` | `height: '100vh'` | Viewport height |
| `min-h-screen` | `minHeight: '100vh'` | Minimum viewport height |
| `max-w-md` | `maxWidth: 'md'` or `maxWidth: 768` | Max width (breakpoint) |
| `max-w-screen-lg` | `maxWidth: 'lg'` | Max width large |

### Colors

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `bg-white` | `bgcolor: 'background.paper'` or `bgcolor: 'white'` | Background white |
| `bg-gray-100` | `bgcolor: 'grey.100'` | Background grey |
| `bg-blue-500` | `bgcolor: 'primary.main'` | Primary color |
| `text-gray-900` | `color: 'text.primary'` | Text primary |
| `text-gray-600` | `color: 'text.secondary'` | Text secondary |
| `text-red-500` | `color: 'error.main'` | Error color |
| `text-green-600` | `color: 'success.main'` | Success color |
| `text-muted-foreground` | `color: 'text.secondary'` | Muted text |
| `border-gray-200` | `borderColor: 'divider'` | Border color |

### Typography

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `text-sm` | `fontSize: '0.875rem'` or use `variant="body2"` | Small text |
| `text-base` | `fontSize: '1rem'` or use `variant="body1"` | Base text |
| `text-lg` | `fontSize: '1.125rem'` | Large text |
| `text-xl` | `fontSize: '1.25rem'` | Extra large |
| `text-2xl` | `fontSize: '1.5rem'` or use `variant="h6"` | Heading small |
| `text-3xl` | `fontSize: '1.875rem'` or use `variant="h5"` | Heading medium |
| `font-bold` | `fontWeight: 'bold'` or `fontWeight: 700` | Bold |
| `font-medium` | `fontWeight: 'medium'` or `fontWeight: 500` | Medium |
| `text-center` | `textAlign: 'center'` | Center align |

### Borders & Radius

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `border` | `border: 1` or `border: '1px solid'` | Border |
| `border-2` | `border: 2` | Border 2px |
| `rounded` | `borderRadius: 1` | Rounded (theme) |
| `rounded-md` | `borderRadius: 2` | Rounded medium |
| `rounded-lg` | `borderRadius: 3` | Rounded large |
| `rounded-full` | `borderRadius: '50%'` | Fully rounded |

### Shadows & Effects

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `shadow` | `boxShadow: 1` | Shadow (theme.shadows[1]) |
| `shadow-md` | `boxShadow: 3` | Medium shadow |
| `shadow-lg` | `boxShadow: 5` | Large shadow |
| `opacity-50` | `opacity: 0.5` | Half opacity |

### Positioning

| Tailwind | sx Prop | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `relative` | `position: 'relative'` | Relative position |
| `absolute` | `position: 'absolute'` | Absolute position |
| `fixed` | `position: 'fixed'` | Fixed position |
| `sticky` | `position: 'sticky'` | Sticky position |
| `inset-0` | `inset: 0` | All sides to 0 |
| `top-0` | `top: 0` | Top position |
| `z-10` | `zIndex: 10` | Z-index |

## Responsive Styling

**Use object notation for responsive values:**

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Using Tailwind responsive classes
<Box className="p-2 md:p-4 lg:p-8">
  <Typography className="text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl">
    Title
  </Typography>
</Box>

// ✅ CORRECT - Using sx responsive object
<Box sx={{ 
  p: { xs: 2, md: 4, lg: 8 }  // Responsive padding
}}>
  <Typography sx={{ 
    fontSize: { xs: '1.125rem', md: '1.25rem', lg: '1.5rem' }
  }}>
    Title
  </Typography>
</Box>
```

**Breakpoints:**
- `xs`: 0px (mobile)
- `sm`: 600px
- `md`: 900px (tablet)
- `lg`: 1200px (desktop)
- `xl`: 1536px

## Theme Access

**Access theme values directly in sx:**

```tsx
<Box sx={{ 
  color: 'primary.main',           // theme.palette.primary.main
  bgcolor: 'background.paper',     // theme.palette.background.paper
  p: 3,                             // theme.spacing(3)
  borderRadius: 2,                  // theme.shape.borderRadius * 2
  boxShadow: 3,                     // theme.shadows[3]
  fontFamily: 'text.primary',      // theme.typography.fontFamily
  transition: theme => theme.transitions.create(['all'])
}}>
  Content
</Box>
```

## Pseudo-classes and Nested Selectors

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Using class-based hover
<Button className="hover:bg-blue-700">Click</Button>

// ✅ CORRECT - Using sx hover
<Button sx={{ 
  bgcolor: 'primary.main',
  '&:hover': { 
    bgcolor: 'primary.dark',
    transform: 'scale(1.05)'
  },
  '&:disabled': {
    bgcolor: 'action.disabledBackground'
  },
  '& .MuiButton-startIcon': {
    mr: 1
  }
}}>
  Click
</Button>
```

## styled() API (for reusable components)

**Use `styled()` for components with consistent styling:**

```tsx
import { styled } from '@mui/material/styles';
import Box from '@mui/material/Box';

// Create a styled component
const StyledCard = styled(Box)(({ theme }) => ({
  padding: theme.spacing(3),
  borderRadius: theme.shape.borderRadius,
  backgroundColor: theme.palette.background.paper,
  boxShadow: theme.shadows[2],
  transition: theme.transitions.create(['box-shadow']),
  '&:hover': {
    boxShadow: theme.shadows[4],
  },
}));

// Use it
<StyledCard>Content</StyledCard>
```

## Common Patterns

### Container with max-width and centering:
```tsx
<Box sx={{ 
  maxWidth: 1200,  // or 'lg' 
  mx: 'auto',      // horizontal centering
  px: 3            // padding sides
}}>
```

### Full-height centered content:
```tsx
<Box sx={{ 
  minHeight: '100vh',
  display: 'flex',
  alignItems: 'center',
  justifyContent: 'center'
}}>
```

### Card with hover effect:
```tsx
<Card sx={{ 
  transition: 'transform 0.2s',
  '&:hover': { 
    transform: 'translateY(-4px)',
    boxShadow: 6
  }
}}>
```

## Rules to Remember

1. ✅ **Always use `sx` prop** for one-off styling
2. ✅ **Use `styled()` for reusable components** with consistent styling
3. ✅ **Use theme values** instead of hardcoded colors/spacing
4. ✅ **Use responsive objects** for responsive design
5. ❌ **Never use Tailwind CSS classes**
6. ❌ **Never use inline `style` prop** with string classes
7. ❌ **Never use CSS modules** when MUI styling suffices
8. ✅ **Check `.dump/main-template`** for styling patterns used in premium template

